        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Stop Worrying About How You Won't Get AIDS</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #000;\n      color: #201f1f;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: min(93.5vw, 1120px);\n      min-height: 96vh;\n      margin: 28px auto;\n      padding: 57px 55px 30px;\n      background: #fdfdfb;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.5);\n    }\n    .misconceptions {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 72px;\n      align-items: start;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      letter-spacing: -1.25px;\n    }\n    .misconceptions p {\n      margin: 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .right-list p:last-child {\n      white-space: normal;\n    }\n    .headline {\n      margin: 21px auto 8px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 83px;\n      line-height: .91;\n      letter-spacing: -5.3px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    .risk-copy {\n      width: 470px;\n      margin: 13px auto 22px;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      line-height: 1.08;\n      letter-spacing: -1.2px;\n    }\n    .risk-copy p {\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n    .hotline-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: .98;\n      letter-spacing: .1px;\n    }\n    .hotline-label {\n      width: 270px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .hotline-numbers {\n      width: 126px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .america-responds {\n      width: 164px;\n      height: 88px;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: #2a2829;\n      border: 1px solid #171616;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 28px;\n      letter-spacing: 5px;\n    }\n    .america-responds div {\n      height: 29px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #fff;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .america-responds div:last-child {\n      border-bottom: 0;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-top: 80px;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      color: #161616;\n    }\n    .hhs-mark {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .hhs-symbol {\n      width: 37px;\n      height: 34px;\n      border: 1px solid #222;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .hhs-symbol::before,\n    .hhs-symbol::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      border: solid #222;\n      border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;\n      transform: rotate(35deg);\n    }\n    .hhs-symbol::before {\n      width: 15px;\n      height: 20px;\n      left: 10px;\n      top: 5px;\n    }\n    .hhs-symbol::after {\n      width: 11px;\n      height: 14px;\n      left: 16px;\n      top: 11px;\n    }\n    .hhs-text { text-align: center; }\n    .hhs-text small { display: block; font-size: 6px; font-weight: normal; }\n    .cdc {\n      font-size: 34px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: -3px;\n      line-height: .7;\n    }\n    .cdc small {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 4px;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    .publication {\n      position: absolute;\n      margin-top: 18px;\n      margin-left: -4px;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 5px;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 850px) {\n      .page { width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 32px 25px; }\n      .misconceptions { column-gap: 25px; font-size: clamp(15px, 3vw, 25px); letter-spacing: -.8px; }\n      .headline { font-size: clamp(43px, 8vw, 75px); letter-spacing: -3px; }\n      .risk-copy { width: min(100%, 470px); font-size: clamp(20px, 3.4vw, 28px); }\n      .hotline-row { font-size: clamp(11px, 2vw, 17px); gap: 6px; }\n      .hotline-label { width: 28%; }\n      .hotline-numbers { width: 20%; }\n      .america-responds { transform: scale(.82); transform-origin: left center; margin-right: -25px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"misconceptions\" aria-label=\"Ways AIDS is not transmitted\">\n      <div class=\"left-list\">\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from everyday contact.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from being a friend.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a mosquito bite.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a kiss.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS by talking.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS by listening.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a public pool.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a pimple.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a toilet seat.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a haircut.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS by donating blood.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from an airplane.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from tears.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from food.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a hug.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a towel.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a telephone.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a crowded room.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"right-list\">\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from an elevator.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a greasy spoon.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a bump.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS by laughing.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS by watching a movie.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a cat.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a schoolyard.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from going to a party.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from taking a trip.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a dog bite.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from visiting a city.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a cab.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a bus.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS at a play.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS by dancing.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS because someone is<br>different from you.</p>\n        <p>You won’t get AIDS from a classroom.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <h1 class=\"headline\">Stop Worrying About<br>How You Won’t Get AIDS.<br>And Worry About<br>How You Can.</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"risk-copy\" aria-label=\"Ways AIDS can be transmitted\">\n      <p>You <em>can</em> get AIDS from sexual intercourse<br>with an infected partner.</p>\n      <p>You <em>can</em> get AIDS from sharing drug<br>needles with an infected person.</p>\n      <p>You <em>can</em> get AIDS by being born to an<br>infected mother.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"hotline-row\" aria-label=\"National AIDS hotline\">\n      <div class=\"hotline-label\">\n        NATIONAL AIDS HOTLINE:<br>\n        Servicio en Espanol:<br>\n        TTY-Deaf Access:\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hotline-numbers\">\n        1-800-342-AIDS<br>\n        1-800-344-7432<br>\n        1-800-243-7889\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"america-responds\" aria-label=\"America Responds to AIDS\">\n        <div>AMERICA</div>\n        <div>RESPONDS</div>\n        <div>TO AIDS</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"hhs-mark\">\n        <div class=\"hhs-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hhs-text\">\n          U.S. DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH &amp; HUMAN SERVICES\n          <small>Public Health Service</small>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cdc\">CDC<small>CENTERS FOR DISEASE CONTROL</small></div>\n    </footer>\n    <div class=\"publication\">NAIEP 10-91 P110</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
